	(text "Loss on both FETs at Solar MPP with FET@125°C -> Rds(on)=33mR\n(2*0.033R * (2*0.18A)²)/(2*5.89V*0.18A) = 0.41%\nCould select FET with lower Rds(on),\nbut AO3400A is a basic part so cheeper.\n\nThe zener limits the GS Voltage.\nmax. for AO3400A is 12V\nleave 2V space so 10V Zeher with low leakage @ 5V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 108.966 113.03 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
